cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NEXBENCH in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "NEXBENCH: a reproducible benchmark for autonomous Web3 agents"
abstract: >-
  NEXBENCH evaluates autonomous agents on 214 on-chain tasks across eight
  categories — execution, swaps, bridging, DeFi, research, security, analysis,
  and governance — run five times each against deterministic forked-mainnet
  environments and graded by programmatic verifiers. Results are hash-sealed
  run manifests validated by a twelve-check tamper-evident intake pipeline.
type: software
